# Nim
# website: https://nim-lang.org/
# docs: https://nim-lang.org/documentation.html
# description: Statically typed, compiled systems programming language, ignoring compiler caches, package manager directories, documentation outputs, and native binaries.

# Compiler cache
nimcache/

# Package manager (Nimble)
nimblecache/
nimblepath/
nimble.develop
*.paths

# Documentation
htmldocs/

# Compiled binaries and libraries
*.exe
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so